  "tab": "drop_tables",
  "note": "NOTE: drop_rate is a percent (25 = 25%, 0.5 = 0.5%). Each row is an independent roll. Category essences 20-30% (qty 1-3; bosses 40%, 2-5). Monster Essence ~15%; Training Scroll ~6%. Material bands: commons 15-20%; uncommons 1-3%; crystals / Holy Essence / Soul Shard / Log ~0.3-1%; Heartwood boss-only ~2-5%; gear ~0.05-0.2%; ultra-rares ~0.01-0.05%. Healing and MP drinks (Meadow Dew, Clear Dew, Spring Draught, Mint Draught) are NOT on every monster — only overlapping subsets of thematically related ones, at low rates. Mid curios and rare high-sell junk are also shared by 2-3 related monsters, not the whole zone; some monsters have none. Common found junk (Broken Twig, Lost Button, etc.) still appears on several monsters. unlock_requirement_id is optional (e.g. unlock_cursed_dust).",
